<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Special Question ❤️</title>

<style>
body{
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
background:#ffe6f0;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
height:100vh;
margin:0;
text-align:center;
}

.box{
background:white;
padding:30px;
border-radius:20px;
box-shadow:0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
width:90%;
max-width:500px;
}

button{
padding:10px 20px;
margin:10px;
font-size:16px;
border:none;
border-radius:10px;
cursor:pointer;
background:#ff4d88;
color:white;
}

input,textarea,select{
width:90%;
padding:10px;
margin-top:10px;
border-radius:8px;
border:1px solid #ccc;
}

.page{
display:none;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="box page" id="p1" style="display:block">
<h2>❤️ Can I ask you something?</h2>

<button onclick="show('p2')">Sure</button>
<button onclick="show('p1a')">Later</button>
</div>

<div class="box page" id="p1a">
<h2>No... It's important ❤️</h2>

<p>You can only click OK 😊</p>

<button onclick="show('p2')">OK</button>
</div>

<div class="box page" id="p2">
<h2>Shall we go on a date? ❤️</h2>

<button onclick="show('p3')">OK Sure</button>

<button onclick="show('p2a')">No Way</button>
</div>

<div class="box page" id="p2a">
<h2>Again wrong answer 😜</h2>

<p>You can only click OK Sure ❤️</p>

<button onclick="show('p3')">OK Sure</button>
</div>

<div class="box page" id="p3">

<h2>Select a Date ❤️</h2>

<p>You can choose only one of these dates:</p>

<select id="date">
<option>23/11/2026</option>
<option>24/11/2026</option>
<option>25/11/2026</option>
</select>

<br><br>

<button onclick="show('p4')">Next</button>

</div>

<div class="box page" id="p4">

<h2>Which cafe shall we go to? ☕❤️</h2>

<input type="text" id="cafe" placeholder="Type your favourite cafe">

<br><br>

<button onclick="show('p5')">Next</button>

</div>

<div class="box page" id="p5">

<h2>Is there anything to say? ❤️</h2>

<textarea id="message" rows="5"></textarea>

<br><br>

<button onclick="submitForm()">Submit</button>

</div>

<div class="box page" id="p6">

<h2>❤️ Thank You ❤️</h2>

<p>
No matter what happens, I am grateful for every moment spent with you.
Life feels brighter with your smile, your presence and your conversations.

Every memory we create becomes a beautiful story worth remembering.

Looking forward to spending more time together and creating wonderful moments.

You are special in ways words cannot fully describe ❤️
</p>

<h3>- Sukesh</h3>

</div>

<script>

function show(id){

document.querySelectorAll('.page').forEach(
p=>p.style.display='none'
);

document.getElementById(id).style.display='block';

}

function submitForm(){

const date=document.getElementById('date').value;
const cafe=document.getElementById('cafe').value;
const message=document.getElementById('message').value;

console.log(date,cafe,message);

/*
To receive responses,
replace this link with your Google Form URL.
*/

window.open(
"YOUR_GOOGLE_FORM_LINK",
"_blank"
);

show('p6');

}

</script>

</body>
</html>
